            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20241016_CR_source-web_Gold_01.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-07 08:13:14",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "美元指數上升　美元兌日圓升近0.3%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<iframe allowtransparency=\"true\" attrmap=\"{data-gtm-yt-inspected-10=true}\" src=\"https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article-audio?postId=16705978&amp;cantoneseUrl=&amp;mandarinUrl=\" style=\"border:none;overflow:hidden;position:relative;margin:0;width: 100%;height: 150px;padding-top: 10px;\"></iframe>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">美元指數靠穩，較早時報99.155。美國8月非農新增職位達16.2萬個，遠高於市場預期的5.6萬個，數據強化聯儲局9月加息預期，帶動美元表現。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">美元兌日圓上升0.26%，報156.19日圓。歐元兌美元則下跌0.12%，英鎊兌美元微跌至1.3516美元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">就業數據公布後，美國10年期國債孳息率一度升穿4.8厘，其後回順至4.78厘；30年期國債孳息率則持平於5.24厘。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/16705978-%e7%be%8e%e5%85%83%e6%8c%87%e6%95%b8%e4%b8%8a%e5%8d%87%e3%80%80%e7%be%8e%e5%85%83%e5%85%8c%e6%97%a5%e5%9c%93%e5%8d%87%e8%bf%910-3",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/12/20240410_source-licensed_USD_FB.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-07 08:13:15",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "道指低收271點　就業數據強勁加息預期升溫",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<iframe allowtransparency=\"true\" attrmap=\"{data-gtm-yt-inspected-10=true}\" src=\"https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article-audio?postId=16705954&amp;cantoneseUrl=&amp;mandarinUrl=\" style=\"border:none;overflow:hidden;position:relative;margin:0;width: 100%;height: 150px;padding-top: 10px;\"></iframe>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">美股3大指數周四偏軟，美國8月非農就業數據遠勝預期，令市場對聯儲局9月加息的預期迅速升溫。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1024x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/09/20240909_FI_source-ap_Economy_Job_Market_Slowdown-2.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"AP圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1024x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/09/20240909_FI_source-ap_Economy_Job_Market_Slowdown-2.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">AP圖片</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">勞工部公布，8月非農業職位增加16.2萬個，遠高於市場原先估計的5.6萬個，數據公布後，市場對9月加息的概率由不足50%一舉升至逾58%。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">道瓊斯指數收報53,414點，跌271點，跌幅0.51%。納斯達克指數收報26,506點，跌77點，跌幅0.29%。標準普爾500指數收報7,718點，跌29點，跌幅0.38%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">大型科技股表現參差，個別股份走勢分歧。運動服飾品牌Lululemon因下調全年盈利預測，股價急挫逾17%，成為市場焦點之一。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">總結全星期表現，道指累計跌近0.3%，納指則升約0.4%，標普500指數升約0.1%。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/16705954-%e9%81%93%e6%8c%87%e4%bd%8e%e6%94%b6271%e9%bb%9e%e3%80%80%e5%b0%b1%e6%a5%ad%e6%95%b8%e6%93%9a%e5%bc%b7%e5%8b%81%e5%8a%a0%e6%81%af%e9%a0%90%e6%9c%9f%e5%8d%87%e6%ba%ab",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/07/20240730_FI_source-ap_Financial_Markets_Wall_Street.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-07 08:13:15",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "歐洲3大指數個別發展",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<iframe allowtransparency=\"true\" attrmap=\"{data-gtm-yt-inspected-10=true}\" src=\"https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article-audio?postId=16705928&amp;cantoneseUrl=&amp;mandarinUrl=\" style=\"border:none;overflow:hidden;position:relative;margin:0;width: 100%;height: 150px;padding-top: 10px;\"></iframe>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">歐洲3大指數周五收市表現不一。英國富時1,000指數報10,831點，微跌不足1點；法國CAC指數報8,278點，下跌7點或0.1%；德國DAX指數則報26,046點，升43點或0.17%。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/16705928-%e6%ad%90%e6%b4%b23%e5%a4%a7%e6%8c%87%e6%95%b8%e5%80%8b%e5%88%a5%e7%99%bc%e5%b1%95-8",
